{"'Arrays must have the same length'":"E0","`HTTP ${response.status}`":"E1","'No response body to stream'":"E2","'string notation required for auto precision.'":"E3","'store timed out'":"E4","message.error":"E5","INPUT_ERROR":"E6","FINALIZE_ERROR":"E7","\"Cannot find module '\"+o+\"'\"":"E8","'resolver must be a function'":"E9","'Cannot resolve promise with itself'":"E10","'must be an array'":"E11","\"Cannot call a class as a function\"":"E12","'Failed to get type for BinaryArray'":"E13","'Unkown type: ' + type":"E14","\"Can't call config() after localforage \" + 'has been used.'":"E15","'Database version must be a number.'":"E16","'Custom driver not compliant; see ' + 'https://mozilla.github.io/localForage/#definedriver'":"E17","'Method ' + methodName + ' is not implemented by the current driver'":"E18","'Driver not found.'":"E19","'No available storage method found.'":"E20","'Invalid mode: ' + mode":"E21","'Invalid version: ' + version":"E22","'Invalid mode'":"E23","'Param is not a string'":"E24","'Unknown mode: ' + string":"E25","'Invalid data'":"E26","'The amount of data is too big to be stored in a QR Code'":"E27","'\\n' +\n      'The chosen QR Code version cannot contain this amount of data.\\n' +\n      'Minimum version required to store current data is: ' + bestVersion + '.\\n'":"E28","'No input text'":"E29","'Encoder not initialized'":"E30","'\"' + data + '\"' +\n      ' cannot be encoded with mode ' + Mode.toString(mode) +\n      '.\\n Suggested mode is: ' + Mode.toString(bestMode)":"E31","'\"version\" cannot be null or undefined'":"E32","'\"version\" should be in range from 1 to 40'":"E33","'\"toSJISFunc\" is not a valid function.'":"E34","'Invalid QR Code version'":"E35"}